          "name": "S3 Rule Box Text",
          "fill": "#cbd5e1",
          "content": "Metadata: ID = C02_ETH_TREND_PULLBACK_V2 | Timeframe: 1h | Eligible: ETH/IDR, SOL/IDR\n\nENTRY LOGIC [AND Operator]:\n  ├─ [Rule 1] Close > EMA_200 (Macro Bull Confirmation Gate)\n  ├─ [Rule 2] Close Pullback to EMA_20 (Tolerance <= 0.50x ATR-14)\n  └─ [Rule 3] RSI_14 Between 45.0 and 65.0 (Momentum Absorption Zone)\n\nPREDICTIVE AI META-FILTER:\n  • Model ID: m02_xgboost_cpu_v2 (ONNX Runtime, C-Inference < 1.8ms)\n  • Platt Sigmoid Threshold: P >= 40.0% (Empirical Win Probability)\n  • Status: Active Filter Enabled\n\nRISK & ORDER MANAGEMENT GOVERNANCE:\n  • Fixed Fractional Risk: 1.5% Equity per Trade (Floor Rp 10.000)\n  • Stop-Loss Level: Entry Price - 1.75x ATR\n  • Take-Profit Level: Entry Price + 3.50x ATR (R:R Ratio 2:1)\n  • Trailing Stop Ratchet: Activate at +1.50x ATR, Trail Distance 2.00x ATR\n  • Time-Decay Exit: Breakeven shift after 14 stagnant 1h bars\n  • Execution Mode: 100% Post-Only Maker Limit (15-Min Auto-Timeout)\n\nPYTHON PLUGIN CODE OVERRIDE:\n  @register_strategy(\"C02_ETH_TREND_PULLBACK_V2\")\n  class C02Strategy(BaseStrategy):\n      def evaluate_entry(self, frame, pair) -> bool:\n          # Vectorized feature computation via NumPy\n          return close > ema_200 and rsi_14 > 45.0 and p_ai >= 0.40",
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        },
